sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Frontend
  participant API as WP /phase2/checkout
  participant WC as WooCommerce
  participant Pay as Payment Gateway
  participant Webhook as WP Webhook

  User->>Frontend: Click Checkout (Order mode)
  Frontend->>API: POST /checkout {cart, shipping, mode=order}
  API->>WC: Create WC Order
  WC-->>API: OrderID, pay_url
  API-->>Frontend: pay_url
  Frontend->>Pay: Redirect user to pay_url
  Pay-->>User: Payment UI
  User->>Pay: Complete Payment
  Pay-->>Webhook: POST /wc/webhook/payment
  Webhook->>WC: Verify Order Status
  WC-->>Webhook: status=paid
  Webhook->>API: Update bjt_order status=paid
  API-->>Frontend: WS / poll order paid
  Frontend-->>User: Show Payment Success 